The original Home menu silhouettes reproduce the user's supplied reference,
2-Foto-2.jpg. REFERENCE.json records its SHA-256 and original crop regions.
No screenshot or local user path is required to regenerate the masks.

Games.png replaces the original controller with imagegen artwork: a compact,
nearly square controller, rounded upper corners and cross-arranged face buttons.
Games.svg and its reference region retain the older source; the PNG takes precedence.
Folder.png is an imagegen replacement with a taller, compact folder body.
Folder.svg and its reference region retain the older source as well.

The Gear silhouette retains assets_local/navigation-icons/Gear.svg for
Carousel2. Other menus keep their existing navigation icons.

tools_local/navigation_art/trace_home.py imports the reference silhouettes.
tools_local/navigation_art/generate_home.py generates HomeIcons.h from the
committed PNGs and SVG fallbacks. The firmware draws constexpr one-bit masks
without loading images or allocating image buffers at runtime.
